Step 2 – Install Required Packages

Inside the backend:

/Ecommerce-app/backend$ npm install bcrypt jsonwebtoken

Why?

bcrypt

Encrypts passwords
Passwords are never stored in plain text

jsonwebtoken

Creates JWT tokens
Used by almost every production Node.js application

