Step 4 – Create Authentication APIs

We'll implement:

POST /register
POST /login

The logic will be:

Register
Receive user

↓

Hash password

↓

Store in PostgreSQL

↓

Return success
Login
Receive email/password

↓

Find user

↓

Compare password

↓

Generate JWT

↓

Return token
